        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund... wait, Raimund!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taking you away from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what's going on. I won't let them take you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to be scared. Come with me. We'll help you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No! I'm not scared!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund! Let me go... you don't get it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "action": "jump",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "power": 5,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry... was I hurting you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I decided to go with them to Laterano, Raimund.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you saying? Did they threaten you? You'll die if you go there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I deserve to!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me go, Raimund. No one threatened me. I killed Fina. I can't run away from this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delfina...? That was an accident...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! I don't want to hear that anymore, especially from you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "An accident... an accident! Of course I wouldn't point a gun at Fina on purpose. It was a tragic accident... but she's dead! Dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She'll never open her eyes again. She'll never speak to us again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fortuna, calm down... you'll hurt yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to calm down... I don't want to be crying like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why doesn't anyone blame me? Why does everyone call it an accident? As though that means Fina's death didn't matter?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I killed Fina! What difference does it make that it was an accident?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Breathe. Don't hold it in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#2$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff... hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feeling better?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Raimund. I shouldn't be like this, but I don't know what to do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only know that I can't go. I can't run away and pretend nothing happened. I can't accept that it was an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my sin...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No more talking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about me, Raimund. It might not be that bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Serpilia, that Lateran emissary who came today, she was kind to me. I wasn't mistreated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe they'll lock me up when we get to Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have horns now... I don't know if I'm Sankta anymore. It doesn't really matter if I'm not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, I'm fine, Raimund. You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let it happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't just leave you like this, Fortuna\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund? What are you...?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eek!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
