    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He hung up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you get Richele over to your side?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's an exaggeration. He's always been that type who only does what's good for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's even better than I am at looking out for himself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like I'm being watched...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has your paranoia finally caused you to hallucinate, Oren?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather believe that there really is someone watching in the shadows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a joke. Don't look at me like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the fallen angel you were watching?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sound asleep, I would think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay on topic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What were you saying about pushing the schedule forward? Not that you can't, but that's not what we agreed on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why the sudden change? Give me a reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What difference does it make to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not much, which is why I can choose not to cooperate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless my memory deceives me, I have command of the troops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm prepared to write a report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're anxious, Oren. What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a secret operation. It's not so easy to deploy troops, if the matter of the saints didn't catch His Holiness's attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even then, His Holiness seems to have noticed something, and specifically sent Federico... you know how hard it is to pull wool over Federico's eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really think you succeeded?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I would say I know him well enough. There won't be much trouble if he doesn't pursue the matter. Our goal is just to stop everyone who wants to leave, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the other hand, the beast is out of the bag the moment you give the order to attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico isn't concerned about the means, only the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you think so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me just make it clear that if you get on his bad side, I can't stop him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So much for camaraderie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A message? Who could it be at this hour...? Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "See for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Bring Oren to the narthex immediately.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "\u2014Federico",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So much for the wool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything you talked about, I'll take care of. Do as I say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "We take control of the abbey immediately. Get all available hands on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That urgent?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "An old man has given the last sixty years of his life to the abbey. He went so far as to imprison Lateran emissaries for the sake of those Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "He suddenly became open to compromise in desperate circumstances, even proposing something so ritualistic as a final farewell... why do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "That, plus some Sarkaz who are not entirely unknown, and 'visitors' hiding in the shadows...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to act quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got a bad feeling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$2",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take control? What does he mean... why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you understand? The Sankta lied to us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to tell Gerald! I knew it! Those Laterans never intended to play nice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation has changed. It's dangerous for you to be with me. Find a safe place; I doubt they'll do anything to you immediately\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, Raimund!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*deep breath*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I changed my mind. I'm coming with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "39_g1_monasteryentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My, my, what a coincidence to run into you two!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so glad you're safe, Lemuen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any news?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_electrcwhlchrrll",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look concerned, Executor Richele.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I found something that I thought warranted investigation. It has to do with the abbot, but... anyway, more investigation is needed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you, Federico? What are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, ok, that much is obvious... what did you find? Something to do with the Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard last night's fire was started by angry Sarkaz. Is that true?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this? Rehearsing your stand-up comedy routine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough jokes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jokes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oren and Serpilia will be here soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, by the sound of it, you knew Oren hid on purpose from the get-go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Obviously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just his luck, isn't it? He just can't seem to get away from you, whether at the Summit of Nations or now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I allowed Oren to act of his own accord, because the complicated situation at the Sanctilaminium Ambrosii called for a Plan B.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "But maybe he needs a reminder...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what's going on? I was told to come immediately and bring Oren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, there you are, Oren. Finally decided to show your face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a while, Lemuen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't you be a little nicer to me? We're partners on this mission, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because we're partners that you're still able to talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever your plan was, the situation here doesn't call for that kind of aggression. It's time to stop, Oren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't you two pretend you didn't see anything, like that guy over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, er, I would prefer if you didn't drag me into this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will deal with Richele when we return to the Notarial Hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gratias, Oren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, Oren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly believe there is a need for you to operate independently, you may try to persuade me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, since there's no one else here, I'll cut straight to the chase.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you really think I wouldn't notice that you were trying to let those two kids go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fallen Sankta and a Sarkaz. Even a blind man would notice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been patient for far too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you criticizing my methods?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not at all, not at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have my own methods. We've wasted too much time here. It's we need to consider how to can get this done quickly, with no loose ends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so you decided to deploy a special forces unit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You make it sound so easy. You know full well that deploying troops and giving the order are two different things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how hard it was to come up with a justification that even His Holiness could not rebuke?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, I have one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Sarkaz boy\u2014Raimund? Arson of a sacrarium is a serious offense, that's before I mention that he's Sarkaz. We're perfectly justified in seizing him and taking the investigation into our hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was not the one who set fire to the sacrarium. Your justification is baseless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no need of your intervention until I uncover the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The truth? Ha. Is the truth really important?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is more rational and logical than taking control and securing order?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you not consider it, Federico? Is the truth really so important to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you not consider the possibility of the locals resisting, Oren?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't think you'd say something so silly, Lemuen. If the Sarkaz want to resist...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So much the better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
        "focus": "none"
