    },
    {
        "text": "Cl\u00e9ment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "I finally found you, Senior Federico.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was asked to bring you this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "By whom? What is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rest of the sentence vanishes into the night."
    },
    {
        "text": "The tall and thin figure approaches, his back to the moonlight, his head bowed."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is as if all the light in the room had converged upon him, but the overly bright light also casts a dark, suffocating shadow."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, Federico sees what Cl\u00e9ment is holding."
    },
    {
        "text": "What he said he was asked to bring to Federico."
    },
    {
        "text": "A dagger."
    },
    {
        "text": "Old, but no less sharp for it, once hidden in the belt of a certain someone."
    },
    {
        "text": "Next to the dagger..."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a package wrapped in cloth that has been dyed a deep shade of red, from which some sort of liquid continues to drip."
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The sinner, Holst Tyfindale, offers his head freely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sinner had admitted responsibility for all the crimes, all the evils committed hitherto.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "He has now paid his price. All that remains is a band of insignificant vagrants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will the reverend emissaries of Laterano show grace and mercy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
